    "longDescription": "I'm trying to make a 3D tilt effect on hover (using HTML, CSS and JS) like this (At first I tried to do it on my own, but I couldn't manage it, I took inspiration from this site.) . However, for some reason, there are random areas of the element where the mouse cursor is treated as if it were not over the \"videobox\" element; consequently, the cursor remains an arrow (instead of turning into pointer) and the 3D tilt effect does not trigger. What could be the reason? I tried removing the entire <script>[...]</script> block, and the mouse cursor correctly turned into a pointer across the entire videobox area (though, naturally, the 3D tilt effect was gone). Some of you might think I'm referring to the outermost parts of the element—where the movement on hover causes the element to shift away from the mouse cursor—but that’s not the case; it happens in the inner areas as well. Apologies if this is a stupid question or if I’ve made a stupid mistake; I’m new to Stack Overflow and still a beginner with HTML, CSS, and JS. Here's the code (gonna copy-paste the full code here cause I've no idea of where the problem is) . <!DOCTYPE html> <html lang=\"en\"> <head> <meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"> <title>MiiTube</title> <meta name=\"description\" content=\"WIP - dev build/ui test\"> <!-- ps: i used testy.html as base for this --> <style> /* --- various HTML fixes ---------- */ /* (cause HTML is a piece of utter Shit™ sometimes) */ *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; } html, body { scroll-behavior: smooth; margin: 0; padding: 0; } button, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; } a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; } /* --- custom fonts ---------------- */ @font-face { font-family: \"Continuum\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/wii.ttf\") format(\"truetype\"); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } @font-face { font-family: \"Continuum\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/wii-bold.ttf\") format(\"truetype\"); font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } @font-face { font-family: \"Continuum\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/wii-light.ttf\") format(\"truetype\"); font-weight: light; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } @font-face { font-family: \"Nintendo U\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/Nintendo%20U.ttf\") format(\"truetype\"); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } @font-face { font-family: \"Wii Sans\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/WiiSans-Regular-4.otf\") format(\"opentype\"); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } @font-face { font-family: \"MiiverseSymbols\"; src: url(\"https://files.turtledev.xyz/fonts/MiiverseSymbols-Regular.woff\") format(\"woff\"); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-display: swap; } /* --- body/background ------------- */ @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { body { animation: none; } } body::before { content: \"\"; position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 2; backdrop-filter: blur(2px) brightness(1.025); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #FFFFFF00 60%, #FFFFFF59 90%, #FFFFFFA6 100%); } body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; background: url(\"miitube-bg.png\"); background-repeat: repeat; background-size: 30%; animation: bg-move 60s linear infinite; color: black; font-family: \"Nintendo U\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; } @keyframes bg-move { from { background-position: 0 0; } to { background-position: 30% 30%; } } main { position: relative; z-index: 3; display: flex; flex: 1; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; } /* --- navbar ---------------------- */ nav { position: relative; z-index: 4; background: transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(3px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); height: 70px; display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; padding: 5px; outline: 5px solid #ddd; border-bottom: 4px solid #14c9dd; margin-bottom: 4px; } img#navLogo { width: auto; height: 42px; padding-left: 8px; padding-right: 10px; } #navText { color: #479fa7; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #145962; } .navBtn { width: auto; height: 40px; padding: 0px 5px; } /* --- videobox ---------------------- */ .videoboxContainer { width: 100%; height: fit-content; padding: 20px 40px; gap: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; transform-style: preserve-3d; perspective: 800px; } .videobox { height: 125px; width: 175px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: transparent; backdrop-filter: blur(3px); box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.1s ease-out; } .videoThumbnail { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; pointer-events: none; } .videoInfo { margin: 1px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; pointer-events: none; } .videoTitle { font-size: 15px; color: #1d1d1d; } .videoAuthor { font-size: 11px; color: #5c5c5c; } </style> </head> <body> <nav> <img id=\"navLogo\" src=\"logo-full.png\"> <span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #bbb; font-size: 20px;\">|</span>&nbsp; <img class=\"navBtn\" src=\"icons/sprite-3-1.png\"> <img class=\"navBtn\" src=\"icons/sprite-3-1.png\"> <img class=\"navBtn\" src=\"icons/sprite-3-1.png\"> </nav> <main> <div class=\"videoboxContainer\"> <div class=\"videobox\"> <img class=\"videoThumbnail\" src=\"\" alt=\"thumbnail\"> <div class=\"videoInfo\"> <span class=\"videoTitle\">\"Title\"</span> <span class=\"videoAuthor\">by \"Author\"</span> </div> </div> </div> </main> <script> const videobox = document.querySelectorAll('.videobox') const maxRotation = 10; videobox.forEach((videobox) => { videobox.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => { const rect = videobox.getBoundingClientRect(); const x = e.clientX - rect.left; const y = e.clientY - rect.top; const centerX = rect.width / 2; const centerY = rect.height / 2; const rotateY = ((x - centerX) / centerX) * maxRotation; const rotateX = ((centerY - y) / centerY) * maxRotation; videobox.style.transform = `rotateX(${rotateX}deg) rotateY(${rotateY}deg) scale3d(1.05, 1.05, 1.05)`; }); videobox.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { videobox.style.transition = 'transform 0.5s ease'; videobox.style.transform = 'rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) scale3d(1,1,1)'; }); videobox.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { videobox.style.transition = 'transform 0.1s ease-out'; }); }); </script> </body> </html>",
